///\subsection platformrte_docs_CM_REFERENCE_release_checklist Release Checklist
///```bash
///# Before tagging release v1.0.0
///- [ ] All tests passing (8/8)
///- [ ] Coverage >90%
///- [ ] Static analysis: zero critical findings
///- [ ] Code review: 100% of files reviewed
///- [ ] Documentation: up-to-date
///- [ ] CHANGELOG.md: written
///- [ ] Version bumped: CMakeLists.txt
///- [ ] git tag: v1.0.0
///- [ ] Artifacts archived: test results, coverage, analysis
///- [ ] Release notes: published
///```
///
///\subsection platformrte_docs_CM_REFERENCE_archive_structure Archive Structure
///```
///releases/
///├── v0.1.0/
///│   ├── build-debug/
///│   │   ├── librte_*.a
///│   │   └── test_rte_*
///│   ├── test-results/
///│   │   └── test-*.xml (8 files)
///│   ├── coverage-report/
///│   │   ├── index.html
///│   │   └── coverage.info
///│   ├── cppcheck-report.xml
///│   └── release-notes.md
///├── v0.2.0/
///└── v1.0.0/ ← SIL 4 certified
///```
///
///---
///
///\section platformrte_docs_CM_REFERENCE_access_control_section_10 Access Control (Section 10)
///
///\subsection platformrte_docs_CM_REFERENCE_repository_permissions Repository Permissions
///```bash
///# Developer: create features, send PRs
///git checkout -b feature/new-feature
///git push origin feature/new-feature
///# → Create Pull Request on GitHub
///
///# Reviewer: approve code changes
///# → Review code on GitHub PR
///# → Approve or request changes
///
///# Release Manager: merge and tag releases
///git checkout develop
///git merge feature/new-feature
///git tag v0.2.0
///git push origin v0.2.0
///
///# Maintainer: admin access
///# → Manage repository settings
///# → Merge critical fixes
///```
///
///---
///
///\section platformrte_docs_CM_REFERENCE_configuration_audits_section_11 Configuration Audits (Section 11)
///
///\subsection platformrte_docs_CM_REFERENCE_monthly_audit_checklist Monthly Audit Checklist
///```bash
///# 1. Verify source control
///git status                          # Should be clean
///git log --oneline | head -5         # Recent commits
///
///# 2. Verify versions
///grep "VERSION" CMakeLists.txt        # Version updated?
///git describe --tags                 # Latest tag?
///
///# 3. Verify builds
///cmake --preset debug && cmake --build --preset debug   # Builds?
///ctest --preset debug                # Tests pass?
///
///# 4. Verify documentation
///ls -l docs/                         # All docs present?
///find . -name "*.md" | wc -l        # Documentation updated?
///
///# 5. Verify archives
///ls -l releases/                     # v0.1.0, v0.2.0 artifacts?
///```
///
///---
///
///\section platformrte_docs_CM_REFERENCE_tool_configuration_section_13 Tool Configuration (Section 13)
///
///\subsection platformrte_docs_CM_REFERENCE_build_tools Build Tools
