///|------|---------|-------------|---------|
///| CMake | 3.16+ | <a href="https://github.com/bula173/Platform_RTE/blob/master/CMakeLists.txt">CMakeLists.txt</a> | Build definition |
///| C Compiler | C99 | <a href="https://github.com/bula173/Platform_RTE/tree/master/cmake">cmake/Toolchain-*.cmake</a> | Code translation |
///| cppcheck | 2.21+ | <a href="https://github.com/bula173/Platform_RTE/blob/master/.cppcheck">.cppcheck</a> | MISRA analysis |
///| Git | 2.x | <a href="https://github.com/bula173/Platform_RTE/blob/master/.gitignore">.gitignore</a> | Version control |
///
///\subsection platformrte_docs_CM_REFERENCE_cicd_github_actions CI/CD (GitHub Actions)
///```
///.github/workflows/
///├── build.yml        Runs on every PR (build + test)
///├── analysis.yml     cppcheck (MISRA compliance)
///├── coverage.yml     Code coverage reports
///└── release.yml      Automated release creation
///```
